  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf7dfb0d1b58e0a7492e1c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是“宝冢纪念”的举办日。\n在“每日王冠”遭遇挫折后\n过了一段时日……神鹰成功地复活了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b31a6ba0e79b31453e61153ec300579dff2b8063cf2c3f5442957e05d1e77e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3a41105df38f29d52620ca1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰向无声铃鹿宣告，\n就算没有半点获胜的可能性，\n她也会赢得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "738af8e7dc797fe72274590e966d5d1e38b5c055b84f0da122dd94a33a770d86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89deec5f4aae967218daadaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是无声铃鹿早就察觉到\n神鹰拥有自己没有的“特别力量”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5413fc2d33e64b72081a68713912c0848ecbafd703249a7afcb0d46fdddbc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:901bfda3d34fc3a6a0b2a12d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她也不会因此认输。\n互不退让的两人……\n即将展开激战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e150ed26d2c1a7441d6f2d6a9cdc6493cb0405d87404ea8ec56c6c7520e16c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82086c1fc46829650ab3a36e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向宝冢纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "4743315d92bef0a1d3815aad5f8b1374f193f12e0416639bccc69a7a0dc88f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c55af420860a4a72158a37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最开始时的目标“日本杯”──\n如今神鹰终于降落在那个舞台上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9362e474211b6f1bb0c27934f53af169a36f3059011180deb69df5af45e17f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9684cd918d08fa819deba115",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰能走到这一步，\n不只因为具备实力与自信，\n更重要的，是拥有带给大家欢乐的使命感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1795df449456d42962d6d8e04de385205d389c314c2e953746ad1d0c19708e54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:916e6923ab04d97d4814c295",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她走向了赛场，\n表示自己会好好享受这场聚集了\n特别周及国外强者的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efcc247143d6fc503540010237550a6db36cc5e1b6c6d1e6fb42945c575510c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b999ed7171f523e099b7439c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "a194ff2b11e4dc29465b7e96ba46fa50af90ca4fdbd5410a9fadda438e8fdd1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c00fbd161f2469c7d26839bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”……这个可能会出现\n大乱斗的梦幻舞台终于要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c283ad20e9a7560ff33b7324558421a0aa91aa339eeb00ba6a04d6d4b904675b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac7c7bbb3eeb0e69c91009e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目前最强的赛马娘们将在这个舞台\n齐聚一堂。对神鹰来说，\n这场竞赛是飞向世界的“梦幻跑道”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "372e413b5004bfc5ba0aeff2057fad4c231cb8d6e879868b08d4c523da7776bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1a87a7114ae69632abd80cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在观众们的激情到达最高潮时，\n三人互相向对方宣告了自己不会认输的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f962dd7c17631b07db5deb060daa6b95860b8ad2fd047d672e0a361f5afbbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02a30b64343fc9f7eed6f8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了赢过两人，飞向世界……\n神鹰朝着这个梦幻对决的舞台踏出了脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "090cf18887095882ab322ac2d6824bcf11d4e45f99e3273ec2ab0a523351c003",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147b3c444b0eef592ddd2588",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4828838d4a36d62986abed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰在她的出道战\n成功展现了其资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d61039548178b29c53c04e3d7cc0414cd12a902b315417b9c43a76b465b9d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d5d3c022144c12abafbe1dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且她还脱口说出了惊人的宣言。\n“我要跳过经典三冠，\n以在经典级称霸日本杯为目标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "045334a4d11223e7ec2b5a8e1d3b352ba145f3c8d3f4de8d509c8677c1a7d7a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b65197219b9f08dc85ba542",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为神鹰追求的不是“世代最强”\n而是“世界最强”，所以她早已决定\n要和好友们在不同的道路上奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3937bd3e47452e4985d411c9d5f300cc2b327716cf67a652fcc5f7f0ef3616cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1364af2e29896f8f71a1e106",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了观察她的资质，训练员决定把\n举办于年初的适当时期，距离也正合适的\n“共同通信杯”当作下一场目标竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02f54a928086ee0cef3f1b2d6228c8c29e27d12573b651de026fd1a4290d69b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b97258bed9796e1d848f5561",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・突然的大宣言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f7a04b0d688c4d107a0f2ef49873c2efaeb9d8975c4f084112c15c60480a6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728f41fb52f0ef92b822041f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb93002d443b0ea40f413147",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在伙伴们的鼓励下，\n神鹰在“共同通信杯”中\n拿下了优异成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be9faaa3be57e484f5a996693568c20e29116cda3d56f1740bdf494d40c2676c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8be9e6e7794443da05f4a28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4dfbe56ed40ef004b316726",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，这场竞赛只是个热身赛。\n脱离经典路线的她\n正在烦恼接下来该参加哪一场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02366dca3299163420d10d3cac3d5331dea7fd673cbb55a9be608f429132609c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7764f3c750ebd4bf140f7eb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8343ae0fbc687f70617b012",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这时，她所尊敬的前辈采珠\n建议她参加“NHK英里杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2c794a2c9c0743a06176129b08fb2635cd9400cd9f9fcc297b325f1f9222d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c944f5186b1cddf9b6c36e0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91dcb75dabd6da80e3398f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了成为获得世界认可的赛马娘，\n神鹰决定参加这场必定面临激战的GⅠ赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26e0daa05861a489d78542b93bd59ce9b5c45732e9773f1725c4cdf26ebb6d14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:913535821f430f99853c3af0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "共同通信杯束后・追随前辈",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95afdb95df17d452dc96d69235eab7a6cfde68233cb9e0a4c45f8a8c074098f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014417.json",
      "json_path": [
