      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿一边祝贺神鹰赢得胜利，\n一边说她拥有可以把粉丝的加油声\n变成力量的才能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "756dbebabf14ca0ffab34f6be1f59f3b94bd9e36694289792cbe90b00a9a243c",
