      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是神鹰对此感到疑惑，\n因为她认为所有的赛马娘都是\n从粉丝们身上获得力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf08e40aafa0263dd69a82f119626c658bbe381af2bbf91241df41353fdaf4ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
