    {
      "uid": "zhcn:274aa0c65528f4ede5181165",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰一边思考无声铃鹿这句话的意思，\n一边朝着她的夙愿“日本杯”前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef21e5b52d71f2d80becbf9b5275137a8494e71e93605fb2ce21d0ba015765b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef907dd19e41b19d0dcf06c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・成功复仇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e0c97d822c6552f4e61366eaef135f0aeb9da0f4976d494778feb07a05eef8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1758ae344622253b9881eebb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰战胜特别周，\n使观众们为之沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5640bcad61d09f77a70b0c67c777d9f00c869af90a5f24069da72dd9e5ec3e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c622fdc2f24d54b02fdaaa33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只比这场竞赛仍无法满足的特别周，\n热切希望能在“有马纪念”再战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e57922f1d71bbd593d35de6068127e8d90f95d4195d56e78cecc508afab5396d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:defe80eb47c8384dd155c791",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周、草上飞\n以及神鹰三人──\n将在“有马纪念”交战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "149d6c9decbebf32e5f1559a742c0f1a1adbe47b6f79e65b6d522dc0abd7f171",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f1092292ed35edaa733dce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "盟友三人将在“有马纪念”齐聚一堂。\n知道这会是一场阵容十分豪华的赛事后，\n观众们的内心都充满了期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41abdb05a0f4571e632f18b81392c52873a2b7c806e3eee0a2408c91d4b97ed7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
