      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1794e8680608c961c0bb7cd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本杯结束后・想传达的话语",
      "source_fingerprint": "2745229288aa8f0f942c0c96fa7db2d10faa3d3b87f97179ea8d5016239e50ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b688494a405235359addfe6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦幻对决的赢家是神鹰。\n而且她不只赢下竞赛，还以最棒的\n娱乐表演家身份炒热了比赛的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3885a2de5c1585b78625a3df560b7bb0d6dcb6df655c9940069631c0f2b3f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7743f888329c98c11ee19f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在颁奖典礼上她发表宣言，即使进军世界，\n她仍会继续把观众们在这场竞赛中\n感受到的快乐与热情展现给大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2bd126856221798cd8d4abc742d216bd9281c5200f40051ec9d38602d4501f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59a978c00a467b0885c63203",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰展现了有如天生的\n表演家般的态度，\n赞扬她的喝彩也在赛场上持续不断地回响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9549af26b67ee478bcaf9a6ca68e177fa48f99e9e7dfa8bb0d1e64c2f3a710ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
